WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Snap a window. You choose the position. Put the selected window on the left.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Tile automatically. Rules arrange the windows. The layout adapts as a managed window joins.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Group a workspace. Keep related work together. Windows, projects, or sessions share a context.

4
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Choose the job. Place one. Arrange several. Return to a context. Tools overlap; workspace behavior varies by app.
